cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Process Improvement using Data"
message: "If you use this book, please cite it as below."
type: book
authors:
  - family-names: Dunn
    given-names: Kevin G.
    email: kgdunn@gmail.com
abstract: >-
  An open-access textbook covering data visualization, univariate statistics,
  process monitoring, least-squares modelling, design and analysis of
  experiments, latent variable methods (PCA, PLS), and product development
  for engineers and scientists working with process data.
keywords:
  - statistics
  - process improvement
  - design of experiments
  - latent variable methods
  - PCA
  - PLS
  - multivariate data analysis
  - batch data analysis
